  "question": "When discrimination is embedded in a person's assigned status, whom could an ordinary complaint persuade?",
  "zhQuestion": "当不平等被写进一个人从出生便带着的身份，一句反对的话，究竟能说给谁听？",
  "limits": "The group labels cover different statuses and changing local restrictions. Regulations document power but do not prove the private motives of every person who complied.",
